		{
			dependencies: ["29EE940649C3AE38"]
			description: [
				"Ore veins added by Gregtech create large resource deposits. They are very useful in getting massive amounts of resources and fairly common around!"
				""
				"But big twist with them how veins are biome dependant: various resources like different climates!"
				""
				"&lYou can check 'Resources' tab to see how to get and find various resources.&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Find dusts on the surface that indicate that ore vein underground. You can use your map to see where they are too! Just click a &lore icon&r in the low left corner. Additionaly you can see what type of ores are in the vein."
				""
				"If you not ready to dig underground just collect some dusts from the ground to get some metals early."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Normal ores still spawn as smaller ore patches undeground, so some cave exploration needed if you can't find ore vein you need. "
			]
			icon: "gtceu:chalcopyrite_ore"
			id: "34D049FD2BF84E84"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.5d
